			"hadithnumber": 3594,
			"arabicnumber": 3594,
			"text": "Anas bin Malik narrated that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:“The supplication is not rejected between the Adhan and the Iqamah.” They said: “So what should we say, O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)?” He said: “Ask Allah for Al-`Afiyah in the world and in the Hereafter.”",
